Package: projcli
Title: Call the Standalone Project Build Command
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Miguel", "Rodo", email = "miguel.rodo@uct.ac.za", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An explicit subprocess interface to a separately installed project
    build command. Validates the machine protocol and passes a deliberate child
    environment without embedding a Rust engine in the R session.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite (>= 1.8.0), processx (>= 3.8.0)
Suggests: renv (>= 1.1.5)
SystemRequirements: proj CLI with machine protocol 1 and capability version 1
URL: https://github.com/MiguelRodo/projcli
